ks from The Hunger  Games franchise and the Pitch Perfect  series on the directing side of things  Banks has two movies under her  filmmaking belt Pitch Perfect 2 and  2019's Charlie's Angels in other words  we know for a 100 fact that Banks can  bring the laughs as for the Thrills  we're very interested to see what banks  can bring to the horror table as she  branches out from her usual genre  in addition to Elizabeth Banks cocaine  bear has quite a bit of talent sitting  behind the camera the film's producers  are absolute powerhouses when it comes  to creating zany mind-bending movies  Phil Lord and Chris Miller have been  involved with the project since 2019.  the two are perhaps best known for their  directing work having helmed films like  Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 21  Jump Street and The Lego Movie they also  produced quite a few winners including  the Mitchells versus the machines and  Spider-Man into the spider-verse of  course they aren't the only ones  producing this cocaine fueled pick in  addition to Aditya suit and Max  Handelman Ryan Duffield will help bring  this movie to the big screen Duffield is  one of the most original filmmakers  working today having pen scripts for  titles like the babysitter underwater  and spontaneous Duffield is definitely  skilled at combining comedy with  jaw-dropping horror in other words he  seems like the perfect fit for this  insane project this probably won't come  as much of a shot but cocaine bear is  going to feature some drug use it's  right there in the title and once that  titular apex predator starts snorting  that coke things are going to get bloody  very very bloody after all movies that  feature very hungry bears Hollow titles  like Backcountry and Revenant tend to  get pretty intense and those guys  weren't even using when they decided to  hunt down some humans throw some nose  candy into the mix and it should come as  no surprise that cocaine bear has been  rated R for bloody violence and Gore  drug content and language throughout oh  man  [Music]
 

